at, kepadatan volume lalin. Kembangan KM 08-Kedoya KM 04 padat, kepadatan volume lalin,\" tuturnya. Lalin di Tol JORR W2S juga mengalami kepadatan di sejumlah titik, salah satunya kepadatan di Pondok Ranji arah Bintaro. Kepadatan di Tol JORR E juga mengalami kepadatan di beberapa titik. \"Bambu Apus-Ceger padat, kepadatan volume lalin,\" katanya. ','[0.0029884581454098225, -0.0010576846543699503, 0.01742851547896862, -0.008022438734769821, -0.0023714753333479166, 0.012007049284875393, -0.022776806727051735, 0.003224607789888978, -0.039007943123579025, -0.037012312561273575, 0.024852262809872627, 0.004969122353941202, -0.009725376963615417, 0.000517616921570152, -0.0025477560702711344, -0.008707605302333832, 0.019583797082304955, -0.007257446181029081, 0.020368745550513268, -0.002258389489725232, -0.012219916097819805, 0.035016678273677826, -0.009299642406404018, 0.004320541862398386, -0.020382048562169075, 0.03259531408548355, 0.01286517083644867, -0.021486299112439156, 0.005115468520671129, -0.00915994867682457, 0.009213165380060673, 0.002654189709573984, -0.021832207217812538, 0.01543288305401802, -0.02772597223520279, -0.0055910940282046795, -0.0019340994767844677, -0.021938642486929893, 0.019317712634801865, -0.009692116640508175, 0.0372517853975296, -0.007756354287266731, 0.004217434208840132, -0.025796862319111824, -0.015259928070008755, 0.013490468263626099, -0.00814217608422041, 0.02430679090321064, -0.021446386352181435, 0.038608815521001816, -0.0008855614578351378, 0.018160246312618256, -0.0019889792893081903, -0.006505758501589298, 0.0022667048033326864, -0.013576946221292019, 0.0010610107565298676, 0.01822676695883274, 0.009525814093649387, -0.02381453476846218, 0.0035488978028297424, 0.00339922565035522, -0.017681295052170753, 0.02151290699839592, -0.012492652982473373, -0.011395055800676346, -0.0023082804400473833, -0.00023531820625066757, -0.012705519795417786, -0.0255573857575655, 0.025650516152381897, 0.01760146953165531, 0.012466044165194035, -0.01